close_reason: "Corrected the canonical MCP decision to match optional Apps discovery degradation and strict direct-read/Skills negotiation, with full conformance gates passing."
body: "## Matrix dimensions\n\n- Requirement: every MUST, MUST NOT, REQUIRED, supported SHOULD, removed behavior, deprecation, and error code from the official schema and changelog.\n- Surface: public SDK, stdio process, Streamable HTTP process, MCP tools, resources, prompts, tasks, skills, Apps, docs, contracts, and schemas.\n- Era: 2026-07-28 canonical plus every explicitly supported legacy probe and refusal.\n- Outcome: positive case, malformed case, missing-capability case, unsupported-version case, concurrency case, disconnect or retry case, authorization case, resource-bound case, and negative control.\n- Artifact: checkout, packed tarball, clean install, npm package, npx, bunx, and release metadata.\n- Scale: deterministic ordering, prompt-cache stability, bounded output, large schema, many tools or resources, long history, and concurrent clients.\n- Evidence: exact source revision, exact package version, exact commit, exact test command, gate verdict, and immutable pm record."
